Rule 3 (Input tensors cannot be complex type)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 10 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≠ 11
>>
Rule 4 (Input tensors cannot be complex type for other tensor)
{v_2 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_2) ≠ 10 ∧ dtype_(v_2) ≠ 11
>>
Rule 5 (Output tensor should have the same shape as input tensors)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : tensor} |= shape(v_3) = shape(v_1) ∧ shape(v_3) = shape(v_2)
>>
Rule 6 (Input tensors should have the same number of dimensions to avoid size mismatch)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2)
