Rule 7 (The output tensor type should be a tensor.)
{v_3 : tensor ⊎ int ⊎ float ⊎ bool ⊎ dtype ⊎ str ⊎ list(tensor) ⊎ tuple(tensor)} |= dtype_(v_3) = dtype_(v_1)
